  "details": "Title. \nIf I reload someone's avatar (by clicking the show/hide button  in quick menu, or if they show/hide their trust rank), I will see them in their default state (with avatar parameters at default values).\nIf they change any parameter via the action menu, all other parameters will be updated to their proper values and applied.\nSame will happen if any player joins the instance - all other players' avatar parameters will be synced to their correct values.",
